- Fix: Replace deprecated ~tempnam~ with ~mkstemp~ / ~_tempnam~ @wyuenho #309
  + Uses platform-appropriate secure temp file creation. Closes #110.
- Add support for Android Emacs using Termux @johanwiden #230
